message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite the archived version below.
  To reproduce the results of the accompanying manuscript, use this version DOI.
title: >-
  PA-MCDNet: code, trained weights and evaluation-set definitions for
  physics-aware Doppler radar velocity dealiasing
type: software
authors:
