version: 1.0.1
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.23479449
date-released: "2026-10-20"
identifiers:
  - type: doi
    value: 10.5281/zenodo.23479449
    description: Version DOI for this release (use for reproducing the manuscript)
  - type: doi
    value: 10.5281/zenodo.22167560
    description: Concept DOI for all versions of PA-MCDNet
repository-code: "https://github.com/B10956048/pa-mcdnet"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Deep-learning model for Doppler radial-velocity dealiasing of weather-radar
  data (U-Net with dual decoders, physics-aware spatial-consistency loss, and
  two-stage transfer learning from NWP simulations to radar observations).
  Source code is MIT-licensed; the trained weights and locked test-set
  definitions are CC BY 4.0. CWA radar data are not included.
keywords:
  - Doppler radar
  - velocity dealiasing
  - deep learning
  - transfer learning
  - Taiwan
